{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1340856-410-gun-cane","id":1340856,"title":".410 Gun Cane?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-11T15:59:11-07:00","id":1340856,"title":".410 Gun Cane?","content":"What would be the stats for such an esoteric weapon? Also since it is a disguised weapon would supernaturals need to roll a detection check?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7106-extant-reality","name":"Extant Reality","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7106_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-11T18:44:17-07:00","id":1340885,"title":"","content":"Probably the same as a light revolver, except with less ammo. If you feel strongly about it you can add 1 damage to make it the equivalent of a heavy revolver.<br /> <br /> Supernaturals would need to roll to detect it as a weapon unless they had some sort of supernatural weapon detection, which some have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-12T12:12:05-07:00","id":1340982,"title":"","content":"He probably meant .410 gauge shotgun, not .41 magnum revolver. Armory had .410 gauge at 2(9 again),-10/-20/-30, -1 str, flip in capacity for the specific weapon you want (probably 1).<br /> <br /> Update to GMC would probably be basically the same thing as a low-caliber shotgun, 2(9 again),10/20/30 -2 str (str values are usually slightly higher. Dump it to 1 if you want). Size 2-3 depending on cane's size, init -2 or 3. I don't think there is any set rule for conversion, so mess around with the numbers however you like!<br /> <br /> I'm mainly a hunter guy, and can't give a blanket answer on the supernatural powers thing. You can ask at the main thread's &quot;ask a simple question&quot; thread or just go with whatever advantages your players (so if your players are Hunters who invested in a fairly weak hidden gun, let the hidden gun work. If your players are supernaturals who invested in weapon-finding skills, let the weapons finding skills work). If you mean without their powers then you could just treat it like normal concealed weaponry, with a +1/+2 bonus depending on how well disguised the gun is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18090-ruger","name":"Ruger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18090_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}